    "These are your explicit settings, not test results. Saving disables unchecked capabilities. Clear settings to use the source declaration." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此处手动覆盖服务商能力声明，并非测试结果。保存后未勾选的能力将停用；清除设置可恢复使用来源声明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears only this Nola account’s private credentials and requests remote revocation. It does not sign out Codex or another Host. Remote revocation may need confirmation in ChatGPT settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅清除此 Nola 账户的凭据并请求撤销授权，不会退出 Codex 或其他主机。请在 ChatGPT 设置中确认远程撤销状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This endpoint returned an empty catalog. You can enter a model ID manually." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
